{
  "key": 38536,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ExamineTabletMale",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s good to see you!\r",
        "Without any further ado, I’d like you\n",
        "to examine this stone tablet.\r",
        "Something just like it was also\n",
        "discovered in the Kanto region.\r",
        "I want to ask for your help in\n",
        "solving the mystery behind this.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ExamineTabletFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s good to see you!\r",
        "Without any further ado, I’d like you\n",
        "to examine this stone tablet.\r",
        "Something just like it was also\n",
        "discovered in the Kanto region.\r",
        "I want to ask for your help in\n",
        "solving the mystery behind this.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SayThanksToWhom",
      "en_US": [
        "I tried deciphering the engravings on\n",
        "the stone tablet.\r",
        "Apparently, it is for a Trainer to\n",
        "engrave his or her thoughts after\f",
        "growing as a person on an adventure.\r",
        "A Trainer fitting that description\n",
        "would be you.\r",
        "That’s why I’m asking you for your\n",
        "help.\r",
        "You’ve met many people and Pokémon;\n",
        "you’ve experienced many things that\f",
        "shaped you into the person you are.\r",
        "I want you to sincerely tell me who\n",
        "affected you the most.\r",
        "Tell me, to whom do you most want\n",
        "to say your thanks?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ExpressThanksToName",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm...\r",
        "You most want to express your\n",
        "thanks to {STRVAR_1 28, 1, 0}?\r",
        "You’re absolutely certain of it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_WhatWasThatPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: ?!\n",
        "What was that Pokémon?\r",
        "Is it somehow connected to\n",
        "the stone tablet?\r",
        "Hmm... Where did that Pokémon go?\n",
        "Its destination is intriguing...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_WhatWasThatPokemon2",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: ?!\n",
        "What was that Pokémon?\r",
        "Is it somehow connected to\n",
        "the stone tablet?\r",
        "Hmm... Where did that Pokémon go?\n",
        "Its destination is intriguing..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_NotSuggestingNoOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: What’s wrong? You’re not\n",
        "suggesting there’s no one?\r",
        "Tell me, to whom do you most want\n",
        "to say your thanks?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SurfaceIsUnmarked",
      "en_US": [
        "The surface is unmarked.\n",
        "It is polished like a mirror."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_NameWhomIThank",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 1, 0}, to whom I give\n",
        "my thanks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_PokemonThatConveysGratitude",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: I...\n",
        "I don’t like to talk...\r",
        "I choose my words carefully, but they\n",
        "may still hurt someone accidentally...\r",
        "When I think of that, I clam up...\r",
        "That’s why I think this certain Pokémon\n",
        "is so wonderful.\r",
        "It’s a Pokémon that conveys the\n",
        "feelings of gratitude in a nice way...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ThatStoneTablet",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: That stone tablet...\n",
        "It has a strange feel to it..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ThankYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Thank you...\r",
        "That must have been the Pokémon that\n",
        "conveys the feelings of gratitude...\r",
        "You made it so I could see it...\r",
        "So, I’ll have to convey thanks in my own\n",
        "words, too..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_ThankYouToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: To you, too...\r",
        "Thank you..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignDawnThisStoneTablet",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: This stone tablet...\r",
        "Is there really a mythical Pokémon\n",
        "that visits this? And why?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignLucasThisStoneTablet",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: This stone tablet...\r",
        "Is there really a mythical Pokémon\n",
        "that visits this? And why?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignDawnLetsBattleAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I didn’t expect to see you!\r",
        "I guess you’re on your way to\n",
        "the Pokémon League, right?\r",
        "I was just performing an errand for\n",
        "Prof. Rowan.\r",
        "This stone tablet is meant to be\n",
        "the key to meeting a Pokémon.\r",
        "I can’t figure it out, though.\n",
        "The writing on it is ancient...\r",
        "Anyway, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you must be really\n",
        "strong to have made it this far!\r",
        "I’ve been training too, you know...\r",
        "We haven’t battled since Route 210...\n",
        "So, I want to battle again.\r",
        "I want to see how far you’ve come\n",
        "since we first met in Route 201!\r",
        "Please, let me know when you’re ready.\n",
        "I can’t wait for our battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignLucasLetsBattleAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I’m surprised to see you.\r",
        "I guess you’re on your way to\n",
        "the Pokémon League, huh?\r",
        "I was just performing an errand for\n",
        "Prof. Rowan.\r",
        "This stone tablet is meant to be\n",
        "the key to meeting a Pokémon.\r",
        "I can’t figure it out, though.\n",
        "The writing on it is ancient...\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you must be really strong\n",
        "by now--you’ve made it here, after all.\r",
        "I’ve been growing stronger, too.\r",
        "We haven’t battled since Route 210...\n",
        "I’d like to test my skill again.\r",
        "And... I want to see your growth since\n",
        "we first met in Route 201.\r",
        "Please, let me know when you’re ready.\n",
        "I’m looking forward to our battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignDawnReadyToBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Are you ready to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignDawnLetsGetStarted",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Fantastic!\n",
        "Let’s get started!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignDawnGoGetReady",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Go get ready, then.\n",
        "I’ll be waiting right here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignLucasReadyToBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Are you ready to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignLucasLetsGetStarted",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Alright, great.\n",
        "Let’s get started, then!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignLucasGoGetReady",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: OK, no problem.\n",
        "I’ll be waiting here for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignDawnYouveGrown",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Wow, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you’ve really\n",
        "grown into a great Trainer!\r",
        "It’s amazing to think you didn’t even\n",
        "own a Pokémon when I met you...\r",
        "You’re definitely ready to challenge\n",
        "the Pokémon League now.\r",
        "Good luck, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I know you can do it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignLucasYouveGrown",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: ...\n",
        "You’re really something, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I can’t believe you’re the same person\n",
        "I met back on Route 201.\r",
        "I think you must be ready to challenge\n",
        "the Pokemon League now.\r",
        "Best of luck, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I know you can do it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignNurseHeal",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, Trainer!\n",
        "Allow me heal your Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route224_Text_SovereignNurseGoodLuck",
      "en_US": [
        "Good luck with your challenge!\n",
        "You can do it!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
